                        "name": "Matt Spinler",
                        "email": "spinler@us.ibm.com",
                        "username": "spinler"
                    },
                    "message": "Oh I should have put this in the commit message, and will do so, but I'm going to add a new PEL subsystem to the PEL spec for 'BMC redundancy' but that's going to take a while so was just going to use this one for now.\n\nhistory: FSP used 5E for 'fsp redundancy', but the PEL spec has that as fsp -> hostboot interface, and there are already PELs in this file that use it for that so we can't change those and i have to come up with a new one."
                },
                {
                    "file": "extensions/openpower-pels/registry/message_registry.json",
